## Maintainer checklist

- Review generated `BoardConfig.mk`; do not trust partition and kernel values blindly.
- Review `proprietary-files.txt`; remove unnecessary files before extraction.
- Verify VINTF manifests and compatibility matrices.
- Confirm fstab paths, dynamic partition layout and A/B support.
- Confirm kernel source path, defconfig and compiler requirements.
- Add device overlays, sepolicy, init files and permissions manually after inspection.
- Build userdebug first, boot with logs attached, and compare device behavior with stock firmware.
